{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Now I know.</b> I, the angel, know that the El is justly destined to exalt you above His angels, as they said of blessed memory (Sanhedrin 93a): גְּדוֹלִים צַדִּיקִים יוֹתֵר מִמַּלְאֲכֵי הַשָּׁרֵת — \"The righteous are greater than the ministering angels.\"" "<b>More than me.</b> For you are <b>a fearer of Elohim</b> more than I, for I am an angel, yet it is fitting that you be above me, as they said of blessed memory: גְּדוֹלִים צַדִּיקִים וְכוּ' — \"The righteous are greater, etc.\" For you are <b>a fearer of Elohim</b> in actuality, just as the El had known beforehand that you were a fearer of Elohim in potentiality — so that His active knowing falls upon that which exists in actuality."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:08.030282239Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}